WEBVTT

00:02.110 --> 00:04.820
It's like he's telling us to follow.

00:04.820 --> 00:07.110
Darn, he's underestimating us.

00:07.650 --> 00:09.660
Heal faster, Soul Reaper.

00:12.330 --> 00:13.620
If Captain Unohana...

00:13.620 --> 00:16.610
No, if Lieutenant Kotetsu were here...

00:38.630 --> 00:40.060
You mustn't keep pushing yourself.

00:44.860 --> 00:47.320
Lieutenant Ise...

00:48.240 --> 00:51.070
Save Ichigo and Renji first...

00:52.950 --> 00:55.660
If anyone can defeat Yhwach...

00:58.330 --> 00:59.660
But...

01:00.790 --> 01:02.290
Please...

02:50.610 --> 02:54.030
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

03:07.790 --> 03:08.790
Lord Genryusai!

03:12.000 --> 03:14.400
Please wait, Lord Genryusai!

03:22.470 --> 03:25.560
He wanted me to provide protection.

03:41.370 --> 03:44.000
Captain, this Spiritual Pressure...

03:51.250 --> 03:54.010
Let's go, Captain.

03:54.550 --> 03:58.010
We'll take him down ourselves.

04:02.590 --> 04:04.140
Lieutenant Abarai.

04:07.310 --> 04:09.060
Mr. Kurosaki.

04:10.230 --> 04:11.900
Kurosaki...

04:12.690 --> 04:15.400
I'm sorry.

04:16.029 --> 04:19.750
I can't fix Tensa Zangetsu.

04:20.160 --> 04:21.450
Why?

04:21.450 --> 04:27.250
Yhwach's power is to see all possible futures

04:27.250 --> 04:30.290
and choose and rewrite them as he wishes.

04:30.670 --> 04:34.000
If that's true,
then there's nothing we can do.

04:34.550 --> 04:41.260
Everything that gets broken in the future
can't be restored by rejection.

04:41.260 --> 04:43.140
That's what it means.

04:43.600 --> 04:45.390
I'm sorry.

04:45.390 --> 04:48.750
You can't fight anymore.

04:52.480 --> 04:53.650
Let's go.

04:55.150 --> 04:58.650
Renji? Wait, what are you doing?

04:58.650 --> 05:02.030
Isn't it obvious? I'm going after him.

05:02.410 --> 05:03.660
That's reckless.

05:03.660 --> 05:07.160
At least come up with a plan
before challenging him.

05:07.160 --> 05:10.540
How can we come up with a plan
against that monster?

05:11.330 --> 05:13.290
T-That's...

05:14.600 --> 05:16.800
That's right.

05:17.920 --> 05:19.590
It's hopeless now.

05:24.390 --> 05:25.810
You're...

05:27.060 --> 05:28.350
Tsukishima.

05:30.230 --> 05:33.810
W-What are you doing...?

05:34.150 --> 05:36.110
You're asking what I'm doing?

05:36.110 --> 05:38.650
How should I know?

05:38.650 --> 05:41.240
Ginjo told me to help you.

05:41.240 --> 05:43.320
So I reluctantly agreed.

05:43.910 --> 05:46.080
Help me?

05:46.080 --> 05:49.580
Idiot, I didn't tell you to help him.

05:49.580 --> 05:51.370
I didn't say so either.

05:51.370 --> 05:53.080
Actually, I did say so.

05:53.450 --> 05:56.840
I told him to repay your favor.

05:58.680 --> 06:02.590
Orihime, use Sotenkishun on his sword again.

06:02.590 --> 06:07.850
Even if it's a future rewritten by a powerful
force where even your rejection doesn't work,

06:08.390 --> 06:10.770
as long as there's a past
that hasn't become that,

06:10.770 --> 06:13.060
you should be able to reject it.

06:16.990 --> 06:18.820
I intervened in advance.

06:19.360 --> 06:20.780
Your sword...

06:21.530 --> 06:23.310
...wasn't broken.

06:48.930 --> 06:53.350
Alright, we're now even, right?

06:55.810 --> 06:56.980
Yeah.

07:03.190 --> 07:04.530
Who's there?

07:06.320 --> 07:07.700
Ryuken?!

07:08.080 --> 07:10.700
And Kurosaki's father?

07:11.410 --> 07:13.580
What are you doing here?

07:15.580 --> 07:16.830
This is...

07:16.830 --> 07:20.340
All the Quincies
who were hit by the Auswahlen

07:20.340 --> 07:22.960
died from silver blood clots
forming in their hearts.

07:23.550 --> 07:26.220
This arrowhead is forged
from the silver collected from them.

07:28.040 --> 07:30.300
It's the arrowhead you should fire.

07:57.540 --> 07:59.210
ANOMALY DETECTED
Boundary invasion: 8.2

07:59.210 --> 08:01.210
UNMEASURABLE
Shutara level: out of range.

08:01.210 --> 08:04.260
A high-density Reishi body has appeared
inside the Soul Shield Membrane.

08:04.260 --> 08:05.880
What exactly happened?

08:05.880 --> 08:07.550
Get the feed up!

08:07.550 --> 08:08.130
Yes!

08:12.220 --> 08:13.640
Yhwach?!

08:13.640 --> 08:15.890
What are those disgusting eyeballs?

08:15.890 --> 08:20.190
Darn, even the captains
couldn't defeat him?

08:20.190 --> 08:21.360
Darn it...

08:24.070 --> 08:26.490
Words are no longer necessary.

08:26.490 --> 08:30.030
No way. We're done for.

08:30.030 --> 08:31.700
Stay back... Stay back!

08:44.920 --> 08:46.380
What a surprise.

08:46.380 --> 08:51.470
I didn't expect to see you again
in Soul Society.

08:52.300 --> 08:55.600
Welcome to my Soul Society.

09:03.310 --> 09:04.690
Let's go.

09:04.690 --> 09:05.820
Yeah.

09:21.040 --> 09:23.080
My legs are giving out.

09:25.840 --> 09:27.340
Ichigo, are you okay?

09:27.340 --> 09:29.010
Sorry.

09:30.130 --> 09:31.590
I'm fine.

09:32.010 --> 09:33.760
Come on, get up.

09:33.760 --> 09:35.950
Renji, are you sure about this?

09:36.720 --> 09:37.850
What do you mean?

09:38.270 --> 09:40.310
You're badly injured.

09:40.310 --> 09:43.850
You could have stayed behind with Rukia.

09:43.850 --> 09:45.400
Ouch!

09:45.940 --> 09:48.070
Wait, how many punches
are you going to throw?!

09:50.790 --> 09:54.280
Now that it's just you here,
I'll say this.

09:55.910 --> 09:57.280
It had been a long time.

09:57.950 --> 10:01.160
Since long ago, for decades,

10:01.160 --> 10:05.990
Rukia and I had grown so distant
that we never even crossed paths.

10:06.960 --> 10:10.300
You're the one who brought us back together.

10:11.340 --> 10:13.090
So I decided

10:14.220 --> 10:16.010
that when you can't move forward,

10:16.370 --> 10:18.970
I'll carry you forward if I have to.

10:19.930 --> 10:21.520
That's how it was.

10:21.520 --> 10:23.230
And it will always be.

10:23.230 --> 10:25.770
Until the day you die.

10:27.400 --> 10:30.270
If you understand,
don't tell me to stay behind again.

10:31.610 --> 10:35.370
And I won't repeat what I just said.

10:49.920 --> 10:51.170
What a surprise.

10:53.510 --> 10:57.430
I thought you'd definitely settle it
at the Soul King Palace.

10:57.970 --> 11:02.430
It seems Ichigo Kurosaki
is more troublesome than you imagined.

11:02.430 --> 11:06.350
Don't project your own frustrations onto me.

11:06.350 --> 11:09.770
You're the one who lost to Ichigo Kurosaki.

11:11.860 --> 11:17.280
Anyway, I have to thank you
for destroying that detestable chair.

11:17.740 --> 11:21.290
Thanks to that, I can stop you now.

11:21.680 --> 11:26.080
Are you going to fight me?
For Soul Society?

11:26.080 --> 11:29.420
I don't think that's to your advantage.

11:29.840 --> 11:31.590
It's not for gain.

11:31.590 --> 11:37.430
I've always acted to destroy anything
that tries to control me.

11:44.840 --> 11:47.270
Ichigo, Renji,

11:47.270 --> 11:49.690
you're here earlier than I expected.

11:50.150 --> 11:53.900
I saw it all. You coming here,

11:53.900 --> 11:57.400
the sword being restored,

11:58.110 --> 11:59.160
and...

12:00.490 --> 12:03.160
...it being broken again.

12:05.830 --> 12:09.250
I was going to break it cleanly.

12:09.250 --> 12:13.130
Your luck is detestable, Ichigo.

12:26.560 --> 12:28.770
Ichigo, you're so desperate.

12:28.770 --> 12:30.520
How pathetic.

12:30.520 --> 12:35.400
Why didn't you let Orihime Inoue
heal your wounds before coming?

12:36.900 --> 12:40.030
Is it because she's desperate too?

12:40.030 --> 12:44.410
Or did you think it would be too late
if you waited to be healed?

12:45.740 --> 12:51.380
Even though you're here,
nothing will change.

12:55.840 --> 12:58.590
And you, Renji Abarai.

13:00.880 --> 13:02.010
Bankai!

13:02.680 --> 13:04.850
Soo Zabimaru!

13:08.600 --> 13:09.600
Darn it!

13:09.600 --> 13:11.440
You still don't understand?

13:12.980 --> 13:14.360
Renji!

13:14.360 --> 13:17.070
Bankai is useless here.

13:17.070 --> 13:21.610
All Bankai have already
been shattered in the future.

13:21.610 --> 13:27.200
To make you who oppose me
understand better,

13:27.200 --> 13:30.080
I'll shatter you with my own hands.

13:33.880 --> 13:34.880
Aizen.

13:35.340 --> 13:38.210
You're protecting Renji Abarai?

13:38.210 --> 13:39.650
Interesting.

13:39.650 --> 13:45.970
Isn't banding together against a common
enemy the loser's way you hate most?

13:50.560 --> 13:52.310
Hado Number 99:

13:52.850 --> 13:54.310
Goryutenmetsu.

14:04.990 --> 14:09.450
And Sosuke Aizen, did you realize

14:09.450 --> 14:13.620
that your Kyokasuigetsu is already broken?

14:20.210 --> 14:23.380
It's useless. I saw that too,

14:23.380 --> 14:24.760
Ichigo.

14:26.390 --> 14:28.430
What a pity.

14:29.100 --> 14:34.020
You read the situation and
immediately worked with Sosuke Aizen.

14:34.020 --> 14:35.270
It's truly impressive.

14:35.270 --> 14:39.320
But Kyokasuigetsu
is no match for my power.

14:39.730 --> 14:44.200
The one sent flying by my first attack
would be Renji Abarai.

14:44.610 --> 14:49.580
The one whose arm
I'll break next is you, Ichigo.

14:50.160 --> 14:52.330
I've seen it all.

14:55.920 --> 14:58.500
It's over, Ichigo!

15:04.470 --> 15:06.970
Farewell, Ichigo.

15:06.970 --> 15:09.850
Your resistance was enjoyable.

15:10.260 --> 15:15.100
At least, be destroyed
along with Soul Society.

15:16.770 --> 15:18.360
Is that so?

15:20.110 --> 15:24.070
Do I look like Ichigo Kurosaki?

15:31.370 --> 15:35.790
Getsuga Tensho!

15:54.100 --> 15:55.640
Not bad.

15:56.600 --> 16:00.520
You synced with my Kyokasuigetsu in an instant.

16:00.940 --> 16:04.150
I felt something was off on the way here.

16:05.030 --> 16:08.530
I sensed that you were
using Kyokasuigetsu on everyone.

16:09.530 --> 16:10.660
That's right.

16:11.040 --> 16:15.290
I used Kyokasuigetsu
before you arrived here.

16:15.870 --> 16:19.170
Then I confirmed that Kyokasuigetsu

16:19.610 --> 16:23.170
could interfere with the future
he saw with the Almighty.

16:23.630 --> 16:27.670
Next it'd be up to you,
who wasn't affected by Kyokasuigetsu.

16:28.090 --> 16:32.090
I never thought that keeping you
from seeing me use Kyokasuigetsu

16:32.090 --> 16:34.600
would come in handy like this.

16:36.600 --> 16:37.850
Ichigo Kurosaki...

16:42.150 --> 16:43.270
Aizen!

16:46.510 --> 16:49.080
Kyokasuigetsu is undone.

16:49.080 --> 16:51.570
Was it due to carelessness,
or did you reach your limit?

16:52.910 --> 16:59.580
Ichigo, you thought
that would be enough to kill me?

17:01.080 --> 17:04.500
My power can change the future.

17:04.500 --> 17:08.380
I can rewrite even a future where I die.

17:10.130 --> 17:11.390
It's useless.

17:20.060 --> 17:21.520
It's over.

17:21.520 --> 17:24.520
Both the Human World and Soul Society

17:24.520 --> 17:29.610
will lose their forms before my power
and become one.

17:33.030 --> 17:34.530
BLEACH EPISODE 48

17:34.530 --> 17:37.040
THE END TWO WORLD

19:02.540 --> 19:07.080
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

19:09.800 --> 19:11.710
What's wrong? Is it an earthquake?

19:35.490 --> 19:36.780
Are you okay?

19:37.280 --> 19:40.240
Hey, think before you attack!

19:40.240 --> 19:41.870
You almost hit me just now!

19:41.870 --> 19:43.500
I'm sorry.

19:43.890 --> 19:47.750
Why would I get scolded
by someone from the Human World?

19:47.750 --> 19:50.290
That's because you're not reliable enough.

19:50.290 --> 19:52.840
Fine, I get it.

20:49.020 --> 20:50.520
What's that?

20:51.480 --> 20:53.020
So he's finally here.

20:53.860 --> 20:55.190
Yhwach.

20:56.110 --> 21:00.410
I have become one with this world.

21:00.950 --> 21:03.410
Time and place are meaningless.

21:03.410 --> 21:06.290
Without being present,

21:06.290 --> 21:09.290
I have already existed in all worlds.

21:09.290 --> 21:14.670
Even seeing and choosing
the future seems crude.

21:15.170 --> 21:17.910
As the Almighty,

21:17.910 --> 21:19.970
I will return everything to nothingness

21:19.970 --> 21:22.180
as the king of the Three Worlds.

21:23.180 --> 21:25.260
Then, with my own hands,

21:25.260 --> 21:28.450
I will create a new world.

22:01.760 --> 22:04.510
We won't let you do that.

22:04.880 --> 22:07.710
That's right. This world...

22:08.060 --> 22:09.930
...will be protected by us!

22:10.350 --> 22:11.430
Well said.

22:14.400 --> 22:18.070
I won't say we have to die
for the Court Guard.

22:18.070 --> 22:20.190
Head Captain Kyoraku?

22:20.190 --> 22:21.650
Listen up.

22:21.650 --> 22:25.950
We'll protect this world
and make it back alive.

22:25.950 --> 22:28.450
Not a single one of us shall fall behind.

22:28.910 --> 22:30.950
If anyone falls behind,

22:31.350 --> 22:33.710
that's a capital offense.

22:33.710 --> 22:37.380
Don't think you can trample
on our world again.

22:38.090 --> 22:41.130
We'll definitely protect Hueco Mundo!

22:42.050 --> 22:44.130
King of the Three Worlds?

22:45.390 --> 22:47.760
Before I kill Kurosaki,

22:47.760 --> 22:50.430
I'll have to kill you first.

23:05.610 --> 23:06.780
Ishida?

23:11.450 --> 23:14.040
Sorry to keep you waiting, Kurosaki.

23:16.290 --> 23:18.290
You're such a show-off.

23:18.720 --> 23:19.910
You're too slow.

23:25.550 --> 23:27.010
Let's go.

23:27.010 --> 23:28.050
Yeah.

23:36.020 --> 23:40.450
If you want to be saved,
believe in yourself.

23:41.040 --> 23:44.210
If you believe in yourself,

23:44.210 --> 23:48.670
those who believe so will be saved.

23:48.670 --> 23:51.330
BLEACH EPISODE 49:
THE BLADE
